sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User
    participant Frontend as Frontend
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant Project as Project Service
    participant Orchestrator as Orchestrator
    participant Queue as Job Queue
    participant Worker as Worker
    participant Artifact as Artifact Store
    participant DB as Metadata DB

    User->>Frontend: Open release workflow and confirm deployment options
    Frontend->>Gateway: Submit release request with environment, commit, and rollout policy
    Gateway->>Auth: Validate session, team membership, and deploy permissions
    Auth-->>Gateway: Return identity, scopes, and approval context
    Gateway->>Project: Load service configuration, release template, and environment defaults
    Project-->>Gateway: Return normalized release settings and dependency graph
    Gateway->>DB: Create release record with pending status and full request snapshot
    DB-->>Gateway: Persisted release id and audit metadata
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: Start release planning with release id and deployment graph
    Orchestrator->>Queue: Enqueue rollout preparation job with ordered execution plan
    Queue-->>Worker: Dispatch rollout preparation task to worker pool
    Worker->>Artifact: Resolve build artifact, manifest, and signed provenance bundle
    Artifact-->>Worker: Return artifact uri, digest, and verification result
    Worker->>DB: Update release state to prepared with artifact and validation summary
    DB-->>Worker: Persist prepared state and timestamps
    Worker-->>Orchestrator: Preparation complete with rollout checkpoints and health gates
    Orchestrator->>Queue: Enqueue execution job for staged rollout and live monitoring
    Queue-->>Worker: Dispatch execution task with rollout batches and abort thresholds
    Worker->>DB: Persist rollout progress, partial completion, and final succeeded status
    DB-->>Frontend: Surface final release status for UI refresh and follow-up actions
